{"seq":8,"slug":"construction-project-management","title":"建设工程项目管理","stage":"DONE","category":"architecture-urban","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 建设工程项目管理 简介\n\n建设工程项目管理研究的是如何把一张设计图纸，在确定的范围、预算与工期之内，安全可靠地变成可使用的建成环境。设计回答「建什么」，而项目管理回答「怎么把它真正建出来」——它统筹人、机、料、法、环，协调业主、设计、施工、监理、供应商等众多相关方，在充满不确定性的现场把意图落地为实物。任何一座建筑、一段道路、一座桥梁的背后，都站着一套让数百个工序、上千份合同、数以亿计资金有序运转的管理方法论。\n\n这件事之所以重要，在于工程项目天然具备「一次性、长周期、强约束、高风险」的特征：投资巨大且不可逆，工期一旦失控便连锁拖累成本与质量，现场又时刻面临地质、天气、市场价格与安全事故的扰动。粗放管理的代价是超支、延期、返工乃至安全事故；而成熟的项目管理，能把这些风险前置识别、量化并主动控制，让交付结果可预期、可复盘、可持续改进。它既是一门工程学科，也是一门组织与决策的艺术。\n\n本知识库沿着项目从立项到交付再到现代化升级的主线，分四章展开。「基础与交付模式」奠定全局框架：项目生命周期、组织与相关方、范围与工作分解，以及 DBB、DB、CM、IPD 等不同交付模式如何重塑各方的责任与协作边界。「成本、进度与挣值」深入项目的两条生命线，讲清估算与预算、网络计划与关键路径，并以挣值管理（EVM）把成本与进度统一到同一套可量化的绩效坐标里，让「现在到底是超支还是滞后」有据可依。\n\n「合同、采购与风险」转向项目的契约与博弈层面：合同计价与条款如何分配权责，采购与供应链如何保障资源到位，以及风险与索赔如何被系统地识别、评估和应对——这是把不确定性转化为可管理事项的核心环节。「现代建造」则面向未来，串起精益建造、最后计划者体系、BIM 协同、装配式与数字化交付，展示行业如何借助流程再造与数字工具，向更少浪费、更高确定性的方向演进。\n\n四章环环相扣：交付模式决定了游戏规则，成本进度提供了度量标尺，合同风险守住了边界，精益与数字化则不断抬高整体效率的上限。读完它们，你将获得一套把设计意图稳健落地为建成环境的完整思维框架——既能看懂一个项目为何成功或失败，也能在自己的实践中做出更好的规划与控制决策。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals-delivery","title":"项目管理基础与交付模式","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/fundamentals-delivery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lifecycle-and-stakeholders","title":"建设项目生命周期与利益相关方","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/fundamentals-delivery/lifecycle-and-stakeholders"},{"seq":2,"slug":"project-delivery-methods","title":"项目交付模式（DBB·设计建造·IPD·CMAR）","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/fundamentals-delivery/project-delivery-methods"},{"seq":3,"slug":"scope-wbs-integration","title":"范围、WBS 与项目集成管理","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/fundamentals-delivery/scope-wbs-integration"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"cost-schedule-evm","title":"成本、进度与挣值管理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/cost-schedule-evm","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cost-estimation-lifecycle-cost","title":"工程估价与全生命周期成本","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/cost-schedule-evm/cost-estimation-lifecycle-cost"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cpm-scheduling-resource","title":"进度计划：CPM 关键路径与资源平衡","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/cost-schedule-evm/cpm-scheduling-resource"},{"seq":3,"slug":"earned-value-management","title":"挣值管理（EVM）与绩效控制","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/cost-schedule-evm/earned-value-management"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"contracts-procurement-risk","title":"合同、采购与风险管理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/contracts-procurement-risk","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"contract-types-pricing","title":"合同类型与计价方式（总价·成本加酬金·GMP）","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/contracts-procurement-risk/contract-types-pricing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"procurement-and-tendering","title":"采购与招投标","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/contracts-procurement-risk/procurement-and-tendering"},{"seq":3,"slug":"risk-claims-disputes","title":"风险管理、索赔与争议解决（从分担到失权再到裁决）","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/contracts-procurement-risk/risk-claims-disputes"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"modern-construction","title":"现代建造与数字化管理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/modern-construction","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"lean-construction-last-planner","title":"精益建造与最后计划者系统（Last Planner）","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/modern-construction/lean-construction-last-planner"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bim-digital-project-delivery","title":"BIM 与数字化项目交付（含数字孪生）","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/modern-construction/bim-digital-project-delivery"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mmc-prefab-site-safety","title":"现代建造方法（MMC·装配式）与现场安全","url":"/h/architecture-urban/construction-project-management/modern-construction/mmc-prefab-site-safety"}]}]}